            "review_text": "旅のホルマリン漬け\nSaitama, Japan13310 contributions\n9\nA friendly and cozy chicken rice restaurant!\nJan 2024 • Couples\nI stayed at a hotel near the airport and ate here that night. The restaurant is not particularly large, but it is cozy and I was able to enjoy delicious chicken rice. The menu is easy to read, the prices are reasonable, and they serve alcohol, so I think it's the perfect place to have a casual meal.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 3, 2024",
